OL,3,GNEWSADad thankful charity scan revealed
OL,4,A'silent' heart attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has described how a routine
OL,7,Fcardiac screening led to potentially
OL,8,Flife-saving treatment and showed he had
OL,9,Funknowingly suffered a heart attack.
OL,11,FSimon Morris, from Cardiff, said he had
OL,12,Fno reason to believe anything was wrong
OL,13,Fwhen he agreed to pay #300 for a heart
OL,14,Fscan after his daughter had been
OL,15,Foffered free screening by a Welsh
OL,16,Fcharity.
OL,18,F"I was 55, I'd never had such a scan
OL,19,Fbefore, so I thought, why not... just
OL,20,Fget it done and out of the way.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
